   },
   "evidence": "prepareMerge (src/git/merge.ts:69-73) runs `merge --no-ff --no-commit` through mergeGit/worktreeGit. At head the only new protections are `-c submodule.recurse=false` in HARDENING and `--ignore-submodules=dirty` for status/diff, and neither reaches merge's internal dirty check. The committed .gitmodules `ignore = none` re-enables inspection of the nested work tree, and the reproduction shows the filter runs. The request asks for every other work-tree git call in src/git to be checked for this recursion."
